     1,
     "Dear Geomorph,<div><br></div><div>I have been trying to map the turtle phylogeny tree and coordinates to phylomorphospace; it does not show any error but shows <b>R session aborted (ss).</b> I tried on both Windows and Mac, all having the latest version of R and Geomorph. Below is the code I used; if needed, I can also share my data files privately. Anyone facing issues while plotting phylogeny? Thank you for helping.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">###Read phylogeny###</span><span aria-label=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;min-height:8px;display:block;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">library(xml2)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">library(geomorph)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">library(geiger)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">library(ape)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">library(ggplot2)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">library(phytools)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">library(Morpho)</span><span aria-label=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;min-height:8px;display:block;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">setwd(&quot;D:/ADMIN/Documents/University of copenhagen docs/Testudines_museum_data&quot;)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">sliders&lt;- read.csv(&quot;curves_slider_matrix.csv&quot;, sep=&quot;;&quot;, header=FALSE)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">tt_ref1 &lt;- read.csv(&quot;JMP_Shape means_Merin&amp;Laura.csv&quot;, sep=&quot;,&quot;, header=TRUE, row.names = 1)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">Tree&lt;- read.nexus(&quot;Merin_figtree.nex&quot;)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">tt_ref1 &lt;- arrayspecs(tt_ref1, 265, 3)</span><span aria-label=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;min-height:8px;display:block;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">T.gpa_ref1&lt;- gpagen(tt_ref1, curves = sliders)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">Y.gpa_ref1&lt;- gpagen(T.gpa_ref1$coords, print.progress = FALSE)</span><span aria-label=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;min-height:8px;display:block;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">Csize&lt;- T.gpa_ref1$Csize</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">shape &lt;- Y.gpa_ref1$coords</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">ecology&lt;- read.csv(&quot;Ecology_Merin&amp;Laura.csv&quot;, header = TRUE, row.names=1)</span><span aria-label=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;min-height:8px;display:block;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">shape.test &lt;- treedata(phy = Tree, data = two.d.array(shape), warnings = TRUE)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">data.matched &lt;- treedata(phy = Tree, data = ecology, warnings= FALSE)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">elev &lt;- as.factor(data.matched$data); names(elev) &lt;- row.names(data.matched$data)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">gdf &lt;- geomorph.data.frame(shape=shape, shape = shape,elev = elev, Tree = Tree$`&#39;Merin_figtree&#39;`)</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">#Phylomorphospace - PCA with phylogeny</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">#Estimated ancestral states projected to the plot</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">plot.pca &lt;- gm.prcomp(shape,phy= Tree) ### R IS CRASHING###</span><br style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">plot(plot.pca,phylo = TRUE, pch=21, bg=gdf$elev, cex=2, phylo.par = list(tip.labels = FALSE, node.labels = FALSE) )</span><span aria-label=\"\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;min-height:8px;display:block;color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">summary(plot.pca)</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#1d1c1d\" face=\"Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">Best,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#1d1c1d\" face=\"Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">Merin</span></font></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
